units real
atom_style full
boundary p p p
pair_style lj/cut/coul/long 10.0
pair_modify mix geometric
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style opls
read_data equil.data
kspace_style ewald 1e-4
special_bonds lj 0.0 0.0 0.5 coul 0.0 0.0 0.5
bond_coeff 1 320.0 1.410
bond_coeff 2 340.0 1.090
bond_coeff 3 553.0 0.945
angle_coeff 1 35.0 109.5
angle_coeff 2 33.0 107.8
angle_coeff 3 55.0 108.5
dihedral_coeff 1 0.0 0.0 0.450 0.0
pair_coeff 1 1 0.066 3.50
pair_coeff 2 2 0.170 3.12
pair_coeff 3 3 0.0 0.0
pair_coeff 4 4 0.030 2.50
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check no
fix 1 all nvt temp 300.0 300.0 100.0
timestep 1.0
thermo 20000
run 20000
